 h-4 mr-1.5"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path></svg>Reset</button><button type="button" disabled="" class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:from-airbnb-primary-dark hover:to-rose-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-airbnb-primary transition-all disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed shadow-sm text-sm min-h-[44px]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play w-4 h-4 mr-1.5"><polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon></svg>Generate Video</button></div></div></div><div class="bg-white p-6 flex flex-col"><div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="w-full space-y-3"><div class="text-center"><h3 class="text-base font-medium text-airbnb-dark mb-2">No video generated yet</h3><p class="text-sm text-airbnb-medium mb-4">Enter a prompt and click &quot;Generate Video&quot;</p></div><div class="bg-airbnb-dark rounded-lg overflow-hidden flex items-center align-middle content-center" style="justify-content:center"><video src="https://cdn.wan2.online/tmp/wan-t2v-turbo.mp4" controls="" class="max-h-[500px]" muted="" autoPlay="" loop="">Your browser does not support the video tag.</video></div><p class="text-xs text-airbnb-medium text-center">Sample video - Generate your own above!</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute -top-6 -left-6 w-32 h-32 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 rounded-full opacity-10 animate-pulse"></div><div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 w-40 h-40 bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-500 to-airbnb-primary rounded-full opacity-10 animate-pulse delay-1000"></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-8"><div class="flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-airbnb border border-airbnb-border/50"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-5 h-5 text-airbnb-primary mr-3"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg><span class="font-semibold text-airbnb-dark">5B Parameters</span></div><div class="flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-airbnb border border-airbnb-border/50"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-video w-5 h-5 text-airbnb-secondary mr-3"><path d="m22 8-6 4 6 4V8Z"></path><rect width="14" height="12" x="2" y="6" rx="2" ry="2"></rect></svg><span class="font-semibold text-airbnb-dark">720P @ 24fps</span></div><div class="flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-airbnb border border-airbnb-border/50"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-5 h-5 text-rose-500 mr-3"><path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z"></path><path d="M5 3v4"></path><path d="M19 17v4"></path><path d="M3 5h4"></path><path d="M17 19h4"></path></svg><span class="font-semibold text-airbnb-dark">WAN2.2 Text &amp; Image to Video</span></div></div></div></section><section id="features" class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-neutral-50"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center mb-20"><div class="eyebrow bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-100 to-airbnb-primary/10 text-airbnb-primary mb-6">✨ Powerful Features</div><h2 class="heading-2 text-airbnb-dark mb-6">Why Choose WAN22 AI?</h2><p class="body-lg max-w-4xl mx-auto">Discover the features that make WAN 2.2 the most powerful text-to-video AI model</p></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-10 mb-24"><div class="group bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-airbnb hover:shadow-airbnb-xl transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 border border-airbnb-border/50"><div class="w-16 h-16 lg:w-20 lg:h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white mb-8 shadow-airbnb group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-brain w-8 h-8"><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z"></path><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z"></path><path d="M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4"></path><path d="M17.599 6.5a3 3 0 0 0 .399-1.375"></path><path d="M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5"></path><path d="M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396"></path><path d="M19.938 10.5a4 4 0 0 1 .585.396"></path><path d="M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516"></path><path d="M19.967 17.484A4 4 0 0 1 18 18"></path></svg></div><h3 class="card-title mb-4 group-hover:text-airbnb-primary transition-colors">Advanced WAN22 AI Engine</h3><p class="body-lg">Powered by the revolutionary WAN 2.2 TI2V-5B model with 5 billion parameters. Create cinematic-quality videos using state-of-the-art Mixture-of-Experts architecture.</p></div><div class="group bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-airbnb hover:shadow-airbnb-xl transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 border border-airbnb-border/50"><div class="w-16 h-16 lg:w-20 lg:h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-secondary to-airbnb-secondary/90 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white mb-8 shadow-airbnb group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-8 h-8"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div><h3 class="card-title mb-4 group-hover:text-airbnb-primary transition-colors">Lightning Fast</h3><p class="body-lg">Create videos in minutes, not hours, on consumer hardware</p></div><div class="group bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-airbnb hover:shadow-airbnb-xl transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 border border-airbnb-border/50"><div class="w-16 h-16 lg:w-20 lg:h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white mb-8 shadow-airbnb group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-palette w-8 h-8"><circle cx="13.5" cy="6.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="10.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="8.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="6.5" cy="12.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.926 0 1.648-.746 1.648-1.688 0-.437-.18-.835-.437-1.125-.29-.289-.438-.652-.438-1.125a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.668-1.668h1.996c3.051 0 5.555-2.503 5.555-5.554C21.965 6.012 17.461 2 12 2z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="card-title mb-4 group-hover:text-airbnb-primary transition-colors">Text &amp; Image to Video</h3><p class="body-lg">Transform both text prompts and images into dynamic videos</p></div><div class="group bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-airbnb hover:shadow-airbnb-xl transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 border border-airbnb-border/50"><div class="w-16 h-16 lg:w-20 lg:h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-secondary to-airbnb-secondary/80 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white mb-8 shadow-airbnb group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock w-8 h-8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class="card-title mb-4 group-hover:text-airbnb-primary transition-colors">Open Source Model</h3><p class="body-lg">Access the full WAN 2.2 model weights and customize for your needs</p></div><div class="group bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-airbnb hover:shadow-airbnb-xl transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 border border-airbnb-border/50"><div class="w-16 h-16 lg:w-20 lg:h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-secondary to-airbnb-secondary/80 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white mb-8 shadow-airbnb group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-8 h-8"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="card-title mb-4 group-hover:text-airbnb-primary transition-colors">Cinema Quality Output</h3><p class="body-lg">Generate 720p videos at 24fps with stunning visual quality</p></div><div class="group bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-airbnb hover:shadow-airbnb-xl transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 border border-airbnb-border/50"><div class="w-16 h-16 lg:w-20 lg:h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white mb-8 shadow-airbnb group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe w-8 h-8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></div><h3 class="card-title mb-4 group-hover:text-airbnb-primary transition-colors">User Friendly</h3><p class="body-lg">Intuitive interface designed for creators of all skill levels</p></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-airbnb-primary via-rose-600 to-airbnb-primary-dark rounded-3xl p-10 lg:p-16 shadow-airbnb-xl"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10"><div class="absolute top-10 left-10 w-32 h-32 bg-white rounded-full"></div><div class="absolute bottom-10 right-10 w-24 h-24 bg-white rounded-full"></div><div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-40 h-40 bg-white rounded-full"></div></div><div class="relative z-10"><div class="text-center mb-12"><h3 class="heading-3 text-white mb-6">WAN22 Model Performance</h3><p class="text-rose-100 body-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto">Industry-leading benchmarks for WAN 2.2 TI2V-5B</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 lg:gap-12"><div class="text-center bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8"><div class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-3">5B</div><div class="text-rose-100 text-base lg:text-lg font-medium">Parameters</div></div><div class="text-center bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8"><div class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-3">720P</div><div class="text-rose-100 text-base lg:text-lg font-medium">Resolution</div></div><div class="text-center bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8"><div class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-3">24fps</div><div class="text-rose-100 text-base lg:text-lg font-medium">Frame Rate</div></div><div class="text-center bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8"><div class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-3">5sec</div><div class="text-rose-100 text-base lg:text-lg font-medium">Video Length</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="how-it-works" class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-white"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center mb-20"><div class="eyebrow bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-100 to-airbnb-primary/10 text-airbnb-primary mb-6">🚀 Simple Process</div><h2 class="heading-2 text-airbnb-dark mb-6">How <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">WAN22</span> Video Generation Works</h2><p class="body-lg max-w-4xl mx-auto"><span>Creating cinematic videos with WAN22 AI is straightforward. The WAN 2.2 model transforms your text or images into professional 720P videos using state-of-the-art AI technology.</span></p></div><div class="relative mb-24"><div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-24 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-3/4 h-0.5"><div class="relative w-full h-full"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary/20 via-airbnb-secondary/20 to-airbnb-secondary/20 rounded-full"></div></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 relative"><div class="relative"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-2xl mb-8 relative z-10 shadow-airbnb-lg">1</div><div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-50 to-airbnb-primary/5 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-airbnb-primary mb-6 shadow-airbnb border border-airbnb-border/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-upload w-8 h-8"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"></polyline><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="3" y2="15"></line></svg></div><div class="max-w-xs"><h3 class="card-title mb-4">Input Your Content</h3><p class="body-lg mb-4">Provide text prompts or images to WAN22. The WAN 2.2 model accepts both text-to-video and image-to-video inputs.</p><p class="text-sm text-airbnb-light leading-relaxed">WAN22 AI&#x27;s unified framework processes text descriptions and images with its advanced 5B parameter architecture.</p></div></div><div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-24 -right-6 transform -translate-y-1/2 z-20"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-airbnb border border-airbnb-border/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-6 h-6 text-airbnb-primary"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></div><div class="lg:hidden flex justify-center mt-12 mb-12"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-b from-airbnb-primary/20 to-airbnb-secondary/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-6 h-6 text-airbnb-primary transform rotate-90"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-secondary to-airbnb-secondary/90 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-cente