></svg></div><span class="text-airbnb-medium text-base leading-relaxed">Team collaboration</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><div class="w-6 h-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-secondary to-airbnb-secondary/80 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-4 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-white"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-airbnb-medium text-base leading-relaxed">Custom integrations</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><div class="w-6 h-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-secondary to-airbnb-secondary/80 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-4 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-white"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><span class="text-airbnb-medium text-base leading-relaxed">SLA guarantee</span></li></ul><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold transition-all duration-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-airbnb-secondary hover:brightness-95 text-white focus:ring-airbnb-secondary/40 shadow-sm h-12 px-6 text-base rounded-xl w-full rounded-2xl font-bold text-lg hover:scale-105 shadow-airbnb" type="button">Contact Sales</button></div></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white rounded-3xl p-10 lg:p-16 shadow-airbnb-xl border border-airbnb-border/20"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5"><div class="absolute top-10 right-10 w-32 h-32 bg-airbnb-primary rounded-full"></div><div class="absolute bottom-10 left-10 w-24 h-24 bg-rose-500 rounded-full"></div></div><div class="relative z-10"><h3 class="heading-3 text-airbnb-dark text-center mb-16">Frequently Asked Questions</h3><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-12"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-50 to-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-airbnb-border/20 shadow-airbnb"><h4 class="card-title mb-4 leading-tight">How does wan 2.2 ai work?</h4><p class="body-lg">Wan 2.2 uses advanced machine learning to understand your input and generate professional videos automatically. Simply describe what you want, and our AI creates it.</p></div><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-50 to-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-airbnb-border/20 shadow-airbnb"><h4 class="card-title mb-4 leading-tight">Can I upgrade my plan anytime?</h4><p class="body-lg">Yes! You can upgrade or downgrade your wan 2 plan at any time. Changes take effect immediately, and we&#x27;ll prorate the billing.</p></div><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-50 to-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-airbnb-border/20 shadow-airbnb"><h4 class="card-title mb-4 leading-tight">What video formats does wan 2.2 support?</h4><p class="body-lg">Wan 2.2 video generation supports MP4, MOV, AVI, and WebM formats in resolutions from 720p to 8K, depending on your plan.</p></div><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-50 to-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-airbnb-border/20 shadow-airbnb"><h4 class="card-title mb-4 leading-tight">Is there a free trial available?</h4><p class="body-lg">Yes! All paid plans come with a 14-day free trial. You can experience the full power of wan 2.2 ai before committing.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-24 relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-airbnb-dark via-neutral-800 to-airbnb-dark rounded-3xl p-12 lg:p-20 text-center shadow-airbnb-xl"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10"><div class="absolute top-10 left-10 w-40 h-40 bg-airbnb-primary rounded-full"></div><div class="absolute bottom-10 right-10 w-32 h-32 bg-rose-600 rounded-full"></div><div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-48 h-48 bg-airbnb-secondary rounded-full"></div></div><div class="relative z-10"><div class="flex items-center justify-center mb-8"><div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mr-6 shadow-airbnb-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-8 h-8 text-white"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div><h3 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-white">Need More Power?</h3></div><p class="text-neutral-300 text-lg lg:text-xl mb-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Contact our sales team for custom wan 2.2 solutions, volume discounts, and enterprise features tailored to your organization.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center space-y-6 sm:space-y-0 sm:space-x-8"><button type="button" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl font-bold text-lg hover:from-airbnb-primary-dark hover:to-rose-700 transition-all transform hover:scale-105 shadow-airbnb-lg">Contact Sales</button><button type="button" class="text-white hover:text-airbnb-primary font-bold text-lg transition-colors border border-white/20 px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl hover:bg-white/10">Schedule Demo →</button></div></div></div></div></section><section id="testimonials" class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-white"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center mb-20"><div class="eyebrow bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-100 to-airbnb-primary/10 text-airbnb-primary mb-6">🎆 Testimonials</div><h2 class="heading-2 text-airbnb-dark mb-6">What Creators Say About <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">WAN 2.2</span></h2><p class="body-lg max-w-4xl mx-auto"><span>Thousands of professionals trust wan 2.2 ai for their video creation needs. See what they have to say about our wan 2 technology.</span></p></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-10 mb-24"><div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-neutral-50 rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-airbnb hover:shadow-airbnb-xl transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 border border-airbnb-border/50"><div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 shadow-airbnb group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-quote w-8 h-8 text-white"><path d="M3 21c3 0 7-1 7-8V5c0-1.25-.756-2.017-2-2H4c-1.25 0-2 .75-2 1.972V11c0 1.25.75 2 2 2 1 0 1 0 1 1v1c0 1-1 2-2 2s-1 .008-1 1.031V20c0 1 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="M15 21c3 0 7-1 7-8V5c0-1.25-.757-2.017-2-2h-4c-1.25 0-2 .75-2 1.972V11c0 1.25.75 2 2 2h.75c0 2.25.25 4-2.75 4v3c0 1 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></div><div class="flex items-center mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star w-6 h-6 text-yellow-400 fill-current mr-1"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star w-6 h-6 text-yellow-400 fill-current mr-1"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox=