join="round" class="lucide lucide-star w-6 h-6 text-yellow-400 fill-current mr-1"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg></div><p class="body-lg mb-8 font-medium">&quot;<!-- -->Our clients are blown away by the videos we create with wan 2. The AI understands complex briefs and delivers results that exceed expectations every time.<!-- -->&quot;</p><div class="flex items-center"><div class="relative"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1043471/pexels-photo-1043471.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=150&amp;h=150&amp;fit=crop" alt="James Wilson" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl object-cover shadow-airbnb"/><div class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-6 h-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-secondary to-airbnb-secondary/80 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full"></div></div></div><div class="ml-4"><div class="font-bold text-airbnb-dark text-base">James Wilson</div><div class="text-airbnb-medium font-medium">Agency Founder</div><div class="text-airbnb-primary font-semibold">Creative Solutions</div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-50 via-white to-rose-50 rounded-3xl p-12 lg:p-20 shadow-airbnb-xl border border-airbnb-border/20"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5"><div class="absolute top-10 left-10 w-40 h-40 bg-airbnb-primary rounded-full"></div><div class="absolute bottom-10 right-10 w-32 h-32 bg-rose-500 rounded-full"></div><div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-48 h-48 bg-airbnb-secondary rounded-full"></div></div><div class="relative z-10"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h3 class="heading-3 text-airbnb-dark mb-6">Trusted by Professionals Worldwide</h3><p class="body-lg">Join the growing community of creators using wan 2.2 video technology</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 lg:gap-12"><div class="text-center bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-airbnb border border-airbnb-border/20"><div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-500 to-yellow-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-4">4.9/5</div><div class="text-airbnb-medium text-base font-medium">Average Rating</div></div><div class="text-center bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-airbnb border border-airbnb-border/20"><div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-secondary to-airbnb-secondary/90 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-4">1,247</div><div class="text-airbnb-medium text-base font-medium">Reviews</div></div><div class="text-center bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-airbnb border border-airbnb-border/20"><div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-secondary to-airbnb-secondary/80 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-4">50K+</div><div class="text-airbnb-medium text-base font-medium">Happy Users</div></div><div class="text-center bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-airbnb border border-airbnb-border/20"><div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-4">99%</div><div class="text-airbnb-medium text-base font-medium">Satisfaction</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-neutral-50"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-airbnb-dark mb-12">About WAN22 AI - The Revolutionary WAN 2.2 Video Generation Platform</h2><div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-10 lg:p-12 shadow-airbnb-xl border border-airbnb-border/20 mb-12"><h3 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-airbnb-dark mb-8">What is WAN22 (WAN 2.2)?</h3><p class="text-airbnb-medium mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed"><span>WAN22, also known as WAN 2.2, represents a breakthrough in AI video generation technology. The WAN22 AI platform utilizes the advanced WAN2.2 TI2V-5B model, featuring 5 billion parameters specifically optimized for creating high-quality videos from text and image inputs.</span></p><p class="text-airbnb-medium mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed"><span>With WAN 2.2 AI, creators can generate professional-grade 720P videos at 24fps using consumer-grade GPUs. The WAN22 model's innovative Mixture-of-Experts architecture ensures optimal performance while maintaining the accessibility that makes WAN2.2 ideal for both professionals and enthusiasts.</span></p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-10 lg:p-12 shadow-airbnb-xl border border-airbnb-border/20 mb-12"><h3 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-airbnb-dark mb-8">WAN 2.2 AI Key Features</h3><ul class="space-y-6 text-airbnb-medium"><li class="flex items-start text-lg leading-relaxed"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 rounded-full mr-4 mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></div><span>WAN22 AI Text-to-Video: Transform text prompts into cinematic videos with WAN 2.2</span></li><li class="flex items-start text-lg leading-relaxed"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 rounded-full mr-4 mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></div><span>WAN2.2 Image-to-Video: Animate static images using WAN22 technology</span></li><li class="flex items-start text-lg leading-relaxed"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 rounded-full mr-4 mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></div><span>WAN 2.2 AI Compression: Advanced 4×16×16 VAE compression for efficient processing</span></li><li class="flex items-start text-lg leading-relaxed"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 rounded-full mr-4 mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></div><span>WAN22 Open-Source: Fully accessible under Apache 2.0 license</span></li><li class="flex items-start text-lg leading-relaxed"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 rounded-full mr-4 mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></div><span>WAN 2.2 GPU Optimization: Runs on RTX 4090 and similar consumer hardware</span></li></ul></div><div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-10 lg:p-12 shadow-airbnb-xl border border-airbnb-border/20 mb-12"><h3 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-airbnb-dark mb-8">Why Choose WAN22 AI?</h3><p class="text-airbnb-medium mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed"><span>The WAN22 AI platform stands out in the competitive landscape of video generation tools. Unlike proprietary solutions, WAN 2.2 offers complete transparency and flexibility. Whether you're using WAN2.2 for commercial projects or academic research, the WAN 2.2 AI ecosystem provides unmatched value.</span></p><p class="text-airbnb-medium text-lg leading-relaxed"><span>Experience the future of video creation with WAN22. Join thousands of creators who trust WAN 2.2 AI for their video generation needs. The WAN2.2 revolution is here - be part of it with WAN22 AI.</span></p></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-50 via-white to-rose-50 rounded-3xl p-12 lg:p-16 shadow-airbnb-xl border border-airbnb-border/20"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5"><div class="absolute top-10 right-10 w-32 h-32 bg-airbnb-primary rounded-full"></div><div class="absolute bottom-10 left-10 w-24 h-24 bg-rose-500 rounded-full"></div></div><div class="relative z-10 text-center"><h3 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-airbnb-dark mb-8">Get Started with WAN22</h3><p class="text-airbnb-medium mb-12 text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mx-auto"><span>Ready to experience WAN 2.2 AI? Try the WAN22 online editor now and see why WAN2.2 is the preferred choice for AI video generation. No installation required - WAN 2.2 works directly in your browser.</span></p><button type="button" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl text-lg font-bold hover:from-airbnb-primary-dark hover:to-rose-700 transition-all transform hover:scale-105 shadow-airbnb-lg">Launch WAN22 AI Editor</button></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="bg-airbnb-dark text-white"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12"><div class="lg:col-span-1"><div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-8"><div class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-airbnb-primary to-rose-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-airbnb"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play w-5 h-5 text-white"><polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon></svg></div><span class="text-2xl font-bold">WAN22 AI</span></div><p class="text-neutral-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed text-lg"><span>Revolutionizing video creation with WAN 2.2 AI technology. The WAN22 platform leverages the power of WAN2.2 model to create professional videos in minutes with our advanced artificial intelligence system.</span></p><div class="flex space-x-4"><a href="#" aria-label="Twitter" class="w-12 h-12 bg-neutral-800 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-airbnb-primary transition-colors transform hover:scale-105 border border-neutral-700/60 shadow-airbnb"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-twitter w-6 h-6"><path d="M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z"></path></svg></a><a href="#" aria-label="Facebook" class="w-12 h-12 bg-neutral-800 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-airbnb-primary transition-colors transform hover:scale-105 border border-neutral-700/60 shadow-airbnb"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strok